# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in your key.
# ".env" is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# The application is fully usable without a key: the deterministic rules engine
# produces the complete action plan on its own. The key is only needed from
# Phase 2 onwards, for the Gemini layer that personalises the wording.
#
# Phase 2 (later) also reads this key from the process environment, so you can
# export it instead of using a ".env" file.

GEMINI_API_KEY=
